## Build Configuration
- Secrets in `local.properties`: `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `YOCO_PUBLIC_KEY`, `GEOAPIFY_API_KEY`
- Injected via `BuildConfig`
- Never commit secrets to repository

