## Key Files Reference
- `Models.kt` — All domain models
- `Migrations.kt` — Room database migrations
- `SanibonaniDatabase.kt` — Room DB definition
- `Mappers.kt` — Entity ↔ Model conversions
- `PaymentCalculator.kt` — Financial calculations
- `BaseRepository.kt` — observeAndSync pattern

